cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "OATC: Open AI Threat Catalog"
abstract: >-
  OATC merges the OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications, the OWASP Top 10 for
  Agentic Applications and MITRE ATLAS into one machine-readable JSON catalog
  with stable identifiers, cross-maps between them, and mappings to NIST SP
  800-53 controls.
authors:
  - family-names: Sadayamuthu
    given-names: Karthikeyan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-3539-6048"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sadayamuthu/oatc"
url: "https://openastra.org"
keywords:
  - AI security
  - threat catalog
  - OWASP
  - MITRE ATLAS
  - NIST SP 800-53
